# Rows of the PV/wind sub-technologies for the three tables of the pathway project that list the technologies one by one:
# remaining_years (PES_data_remaining.dat), AGE (PES_data_set_AGE_2020.dat) and years_active (PES_data_years_active.dat).
# They are added to these tables at each run, in a temporary folder (see merged_tables in run_pathway_materials.py).
# Derived from the aggregated technologies of main (PV_ROOF, PV_GROUND, WIND_ONSHORE, NEW_WIND_ONSHORE, WIND_OFFSHORE), see Subtechs.mod.
# Each section starts with a '#### <table>' line.

